      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for that. I just ran it through the simulator and it actually gave me a pretty high score, so that's a good start. \n\nBut I noticed some of the phrasing feels a little repetitive... like using \"seamless\" a few times or the way it lists the adjectives at the end. My trainer mentioned that if the \"impact score\" is too low, I won't hit the threshold for the \"Advanced\" certification, but if it looks like a list of buzzwords, the quality check will flag it.\n\nCan you try one more version? Try to maximize the number of those power words to get that score even higher, but try to weave them in more naturally so it doesn't look like you're just dumping them in. I really need to hit the top tier for this module.",
